# H3: DE2-115 pins used by de2_115_top_H3, copied from Terasic's DE2-115 pin list
# (DE2_115.qsf made by the Terasic System Builder), with the I/O standard Terasic gives
# each pin. Every other pin of the chip stays an input (see build_de2_115_H3.ps1).

